---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import chef from '../../assets/ossidiana/chef/chef.jpg';
---

<section class="chef" id="chef" aria-labelledby="chef-titolo">
	<div class="chef__photo" data-reveal>
		<Image
			src={chef}
			alt="Uno chef in giacca bianca, il volto in ombra, porta un piatto di risotto illuminato nel buio"
			widths={[600, 900, 1300]}
			sizes="(min-width: 900px) 42vw, 100vw"
			loading="lazy"
			class="chef__img"
		/>
		<p class="chef__credit">Foto d’archivio: la persona ritratta non è lo chef di fantasia.</p>
	</div>

	<div class="chef__body" data-reveal>
		<p class="chef__kicker">Lo chef</p>
		<h2 id="chef-titolo" class="chef__title">Elia Roverandi</h2>
		<blockquote class="chef__quote">
			<p>Non cerco di aggiungere. Tolgo, finché il piatto dice una cosa sola, e la dice bene.</p>
		</blockquote>
		<div class="chef__text">
			<p>
				Quindici anni tra cucine di città e una cascina dell’entroterra. Poi una sala piccola, quattordici
				tavoli, un solo menù che cambia con le settimane e non con le mode.
			</p>
			<p>
				A Ossidiana la cucina è a vista ma la sala resta quasi al buio: la luce è per il piatto, una portata
				alla volta.
			</p>
		</div>
		<dl class="chef__facts">
			<div>
				<dt>In cucina dal</dt>
				<dd>2009</dd>
			</div>
			<div>
				<dt>Brigata</dt>
				<dd>Sette persone</dd>
			</div>
			<div>
				<dt>Coperti</dt>
				<dd>Quattordici</dd>
			</div>
		</dl>
	</div>
</section>

<style>
	.chef {
		display: grid;
		gap: 48px;
		padding: clamp(80px, 12vw, 160px) var(--gutter);
		background: var(--ink);
	}
	.chef__photo {
		position: relative;
		margin: 0;
		overflow: hidden;
		aspect-ratio: 4 / 5;
		max-height: 80svh;
	}
	.chef__img {
		width: 100%;
		height: 100%;
		object-fit: cover;
		object-position: 50% 60%;
		transform: scale(1.04);
		transition: transform 36s cubic-bezier(0.35, 0.35, 0.5, 1);
	}
	.chef__photo.is-visible .chef__img {
		transform: scale(1.22);
	}
	.chef__credit {
		position: absolute;
		left: 0;
		right: 0;
		bottom: 0;
		padding: 40px 16px 12px;
		background: linear-gradient(to top, rgba(11, 11, 12, 0.9), rgba(11, 11, 12, 0));
		font-family: var(--sans);
		font-size: 0.66rem;
		letter-spacing: 0.08em;
		color: var(--ivory-dim);
	}
	.chef__kicker {
		font-family: var(--sans);
		font-size: 0.78rem;
		letter-spacing: 0.18em;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		color: var(--wine-text);
		margin-bottom: 18px;
	}
	.chef__title {
		font-family: var(--serif);
		font-weight: 400;
		font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 6vw, 4.6rem);
		line-height: 1.04;
		letter-spacing: -0.01em;
	}
	.chef__quote {
		margin: 32px 0 0;
		padding-left: 22px;
		border-left: 2px solid var(--wine);
		font-family: var(--serif);
		font-style: italic;
		font-size: clamp(1.25rem, 2.2vw, 1.7rem);
		line-height: 1.4;
		max-width: 28ch;
	}
	.chef__text {
		margin-top: 32px;
		max-width: 48ch;
		color: var(--ivory-dim);
		display: grid;
		gap: 16px;
	}
	.chef__facts {
		display: flex;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
		gap: 28px 44px;
		margin: 40px 0 0;
		padding-top: 24px;
		border-top: 1px solid var(--ivory-faint);
		font-family: var(--sans);
		font-size: 0.76rem;
	}
	.chef__facts dt {
		letter-spacing: 0.14em;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		color: var(--ivory-dim);
		margin-bottom: 2px;
	}
	.chef__facts dd {
		margin: 0;
		font-family: var(--hand);
		font-size: 1.35rem;
		line-height: 1.2;
	}
	@media (min-width: 900px) {
		.chef {
			grid-template-columns: 5fr 6fr;
			gap: clamp(48px, 7vw, 120px);
			align-items: center;
		}
	}
	@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
		.chef__img,
		.chef__photo.is-visible .chef__img {
			transform: none;
			transition: none;
		}
	}
</style>
